hat with them.\n3. **Participate in online communities**: Engage with online forums or social media groups related to your interests.\n4. **Listen to a podcast with a friend**: Listen to a podcast together and discuss it afterwards.\n5. **Play games**: Play mobile games or puzzle games to pass the time.\n\nRemember to always prioritize your safety during your commute. If you're driving, make sure to keep your eyes on the road and avoid distractions. If you're taking public transportation, be mindful of your surroundings and keep your belongings secure.",
